{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houzhu-e-o080m0","title":"邓艾被收押","accounts":[{"id":"houzhu-a-983a24ba3b8e","label":"《后主传》正文","text":"邓艾被收押","evidence":["houzhu-q-O080"]},{"id":"jfj-a-o055c","label":"正文","text":"钟会构陷邓艾使被槛车征","evidence":["jfj-q0204"]},{"id":"wgc-a-7-e11","label":"正文","text":"卫瓘前行宣喻收艾入槛车","evidence":["wgc-q0487","wgc-q0079"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0080","role":"被收押者","evidence":["houzhu-q-O080"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0073","role":"构陷","evidence":["jfj-q0204"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0143","role":"在会前行、以文王手笔宣喻艾军、收艾入槛车","evidence":["wgc-q0487","wgc-q0079"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"明年春正月","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本段原始时间表达；没有直接绑定的公元年证据，未补公元年。","evidence":["houzhu-q-O080"]},"ordering_evidence":"houzhu-q-O080","source_order":[33,80,"O080m0"],"order":6697}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0073","name":"钟会","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0080","name":"邓艾","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0143","name":"卫瓘","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houzhu-q-O080","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-5d3fe85765efd9badd26","layer":"original","quote":"资严未发〖44〗，明年春正月，艾见收〖45〗。钟会自涪至成都，作乱。会既死，蜀中军众抄略，死丧狼藉；数日乃安集。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":156,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0204","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-09db8f32c9900218f0c8","layer":"original","quote":"会既构邓艾〖17〗，艾槛车征","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":234,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":73,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0079","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-513967ffa2e8c3abfabc","layer":"original","quote":"会内有异志〖1〗，因邓艾承制专事，密白“艾有反状”；﹝一﹞于是诏书槛车征艾。司马文王惧艾或不从命，敕会并进军成都。监军卫瓘在会前行，以文王手笔令宣喻艾军；艾军皆释仗，遂收艾入槛车。会所惮惟艾，艾既擒而会寻至，独统大众，威震西土。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":558,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0487","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-513967ffa2e8c3abfabc","layer":"original","quote":"监军卫瓘在会前行，以文王手笔令宣喻艾军；艾军皆释仗，遂收艾入槛车","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":558,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
